        "text_care": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>IMPORTANT: As you loop each step, let the thread lay loose across, making sure not to pull it tight. A gentle drape, not a tug. Tension adds up and can leave the loom slightly warped for an alternative shadow effect. A good rule is, if it can be plucked, it's too tight. For the best experience, find a pace that lets you casually enjoy the rhythm and forget any mistakes- they'll disappear amidst the rest. You want a calm cadence to relax into.</p><p>This is a mindful activity. Slow down. Loosen up. Breathe. Repeat.</p>",
            "read_more": false,
            "sm_size_multiplier": "sm-size--default",
            "sm_margin_top": 0,
            "size_multiplier": "size--default",
            "margin_top": 0
          }
        }
